WEBVTT

00:00:21.031 --> 00:00:22.532
Sugar! Pepper!

00:00:22.532 --> 00:00:23.226
-Right!
-Right!

00:01:21.925 --> 00:01:25.195
What? You're going back
to the fairy world already?

00:01:25.195 --> 00:01:28.932
You should stay around
a little more, Salt, Pepper.

00:01:28.932 --> 00:01:31.368
Elder told us we had to.

00:01:31.368 --> 00:01:35.805
He said to come back
before nightfall, so...

00:01:35.805 --> 00:01:37.397
But still...

00:01:38.575 --> 00:01:42.841
Hmph! Girls are so
quick to cry all the time.

00:01:43.313 --> 00:01:45.543
Salt, Pepper.

00:01:47.984 --> 00:01:50.680
Thank you both.
Do your best.

00:01:52.656 --> 00:01:53.657
Saga...

00:01:53.657 --> 00:01:54.749
Miss Saga...

00:02:00.363 --> 00:02:05.502
Once I'm a full-fledged Cloud Fairy,
I'll show you a super huge cloud.

00:02:05.502 --> 00:02:10.462
When a soft wind blows,
please remember me.

00:02:11.308 --> 00:02:12.297
I will...

00:02:21.051 --> 00:02:22.485
They're gone.

00:02:22.485 --> 00:02:27.023
I know those two will become
full-fledged fairies quickly.

00:02:27.023 --> 00:02:28.012
Yeah.

00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:33.791
They got ahead of you, you know.
What are you gonna do, Sugar?

00:02:34.431 --> 00:02:38.492
Oh, really, Saga!
I'll keep trying!

00:02:38.601 --> 00:02:42.772
I'll make my Magic Flower bloom in
a flash, just like Salt and Pepper did!

00:02:42.772 --> 00:02:44.433
And then...

00:02:46.409 --> 00:02:48.036
What is it, Sugar?

00:02:48.211 --> 00:02:50.202
Uh, it's nothing.

00:02:51.681 --> 00:02:53.615
Honestly, Sugar.

00:02:54.617 --> 00:02:57.821
Oh, yeah. Once my
Magic Flower blooms,

00:02:57.821 --> 00:03:00.415
and my training in the
human world is over...

00:03:01.858 --> 00:03:02.984
-I'm home!
-I'm home!

00:03:03.693 --> 00:03:07.823
Hello, Saga. Wait just a
little longer till supper.

00:03:07.931 --> 00:03:09.299
Ok!

00:03:09.299 --> 00:03:12.302
Grandma, I...

00:03:12.302 --> 00:03:13.769
Um...

00:03:13.803 --> 00:03:15.065
It's ok.

00:03:15.905 --> 00:03:18.135
You're ok now,
right, Saga?

00:03:18.575 --> 00:03:19.837
Yeah.

00:03:20.910 --> 00:03:22.412
Now go and get changed.

00:03:22.412 --> 00:03:23.538
Ok.

00:03:25.515 --> 00:03:27.005
Waffo!

00:03:28.451 --> 00:03:30.112
What's wrong, Sugar?

00:03:31.221 --> 00:03:33.382
Hey, your Magic Flower
is blooming.

00:03:33.490 --> 00:03:38.154
You're wrong, Saga! It's not blooming!
It's not blooming, ok?

00:03:38.261 --> 00:03:38.895
Huh?

00:03:38.895 --> 00:03:40.797
One blossom isn't good enough.
Yeah, yeah!

00:03:40.797 --> 00:03:44.367
All three flowers have to bloom, so it's
not blooming. It's not blooming, ok?

00:03:44.367 --> 00:03:47.137
What are you talking about, Sugar?
This is incredible!

00:03:47.137 --> 00:03:50.766
When your flower fully blooms, you will
become a full-fledged Snow Fairy,

00:03:50.874 --> 00:03:52.808
like Salt and Pepper.

00:03:52.909 --> 00:03:54.399
Y-Yeah.

00:03:55.879 --> 00:03:59.042
Oh, no.
I don't want to leave Saga.

00:04:19.369 --> 00:04:24.864
It's beautiful, Greta.
Ah, it's like a crystal clear blue sky!

00:04:35.285 --> 00:04:37.787
I want to hear you play soon.

00:04:37.787 --> 00:04:39.049
Hey, hey.

00:04:39.155 --> 00:04:40.315
I can't help it.

00:04:40.523 --> 00:04:42.286
It's definitely
more relaxing now.

00:04:42.992 --> 00:04:46.519
I think that piano is
best suited in here.

00:04:47.297 --> 00:04:48.498
-Yeah.

00:04:48.498 --> 00:04:49.897
-Yeah.
-I think so, too!

00:04:50.266 --> 00:04:53.724
But I was really surprised when
Greta suddenly showed up.

00:04:54.537 --> 00:04:57.874
May I keep the
piano in this store?

00:04:57.874 --> 00:04:58.441
-What?
-What?

00:04:58.441 --> 00:05:01.411
I'm saying I want the
piano to be kept here.

00:05:01.411 --> 00:05:05.081
What's wrong, Greta?
Didn't you like the piano?

00:05:05.081 --> 00:05:08.818
I adore the piano.
And, if the piano is kept here,

00:05:08.818 --> 00:05:12.948
I can play music for the
townspeople every day.

00:05:13.056 --> 00:05:14.357
-Oh, what a splendid idea!

00:05:14.357 --> 00:05:16.188
-Oh, what a splendid idea!
-Isn't it, though?

00:05:18.528 --> 00:05:22.464
Greta is a good girl.
Keep coming to play, Saga.

00:05:24.267 --> 00:05:25.435
-Isn't that great, Saga?

00:05:25.435 --> 00:05:25.992
-Isn't that great, Saga?
-Yeah.

00:05:28.938 --> 00:05:34.672
Bravo, Greta! That's my girl!
What a performance! Wonderful!

00:05:37.180 --> 00:05:38.670
That was good, Greta.

00:05:38.948 --> 00:05:40.438
My!

00:05:41.317 --> 00:05:45.121
Oh, my, Miss Saga.
That goes without saying.

00:05:45.121 --> 00:05:46.918
After all, it is ME
we're talking about...

00:05:48.024 --> 00:05:49.792
I got a cramp in my hand.

00:05:49.792 --> 00:05:51.817
A-Are you all right,
Greta! Don't panic!

00:05:51.928 --> 00:05:53.020
Greta!

00:05:53.530 --> 00:05:57.066
W-Well, Miss Saga,
it's all yours now.

00:05:57.066 --> 00:06:01.025
Refine and polish your skills so
you can be a match for me.

00:06:03.239 --> 00:06:04.729
We're going, Greta!

00:06:06.109 --> 00:06:07.844
I wonder if she's ok.

00:06:07.844 --> 00:06:09.979
Well, she's been playing
since this morning.

00:06:09.979 --> 00:06:11.381
Since this morning?

00:06:11.381 --> 00:06:12.575
You can't let her beat you.

00:06:13.516 --> 00:06:14.278
Ok!

00:06:44.948 --> 00:06:48.714
Saga, I'm really glad for you
that the piano is back.

00:06:49.552 --> 00:06:52.214
But I think I...

00:06:53.690 --> 00:06:56.250
Wow, these cookies are yummy!

00:06:57.360 --> 00:06:58.850
Thanks, Saga.

00:07:00.897 --> 00:07:03.957
I wonder what's wrong?
Usually, Sugar is around for treats.

00:07:08.638 --> 00:07:13.075
Don't! Don't bloom yet.
Wait a little bit longer!

00:07:16.579 --> 00:07:18.809
Please! Come on, please!

00:07:19.816 --> 00:07:22.512
I don't want to leave Saga!

00:07:26.923 --> 00:07:29.153
So, please!

00:07:32.595 --> 00:07:33.687
Sugar.

00:07:34.364 --> 00:07:38.266
That's not good, Sugar. You
shouldn't do that to the Magic Flower.

00:07:39.836 --> 00:07:44.500
I know that...
But! But! But...

00:07:45.008 --> 00:07:48.478
Aren't you going to become
a full-fledged Snow Fairy? Then...

00:07:48.478 --> 00:07:51.914
You're wrong! You're wrong!
You don't understand anything!

00:07:51.914 --> 00:07:54.439
You're mean!
I don't care anymore!

00:07:54.684 --> 00:07:55.844
Sugar!

00:07:59.689 --> 00:08:02.055
You're the one who
doesn't understand.

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:13.002
Hey, Sugar.

00:08:13.002 --> 00:08:16.072
Listen, our Magic Flowers
are about to bloom!

00:08:16.072 --> 00:08:20.009
It's only a matter of time before we
become full-fledged Season Fairies.

00:08:20.009 --> 00:08:21.203
How's yours doing, Sugar?

00:08:24.380 --> 00:08:25.181
-What's with her?

00:08:25.181 --> 00:08:28.284
-What's with her?
-She's jealous of our Magic Flowers.

00:08:28.284 --> 00:08:28.851
-I see.

00:08:28.851 --> 00:08:30.375
-I see.
-Yeah.

00:08:32.455 --> 00:08:37.260
Saga, aren't you lonely?
Do you want me to leave you?

00:08:37.260 --> 00:08:40.024
Don't you care that we
won't see each other again?

00:08:44.200 --> 00:08:46.225
W-What are you doing, Sugar?

00:08:46.669 --> 00:08:49.536
I'm sorry, Elder.
Are you ok?

00:08:54.343 --> 00:08:56.868
Sugar. Sugar.

00:08:58.681 --> 00:09:00.672
Elder!

00:09:05.988 --> 00:09:09.583
So, your Magic Flower
is finally about to bloom.

00:09:12.128 --> 00:09:15.063
But what should I do?

00:09:15.164 --> 00:09:18.835
Tell me, Elder.
What should I do?

00:09:18.835 --> 00:09:21.030
I don't know.
What should you do?

00:09:21.671 --> 00:09:24.435
Oh, couldn't you
give me a hint?

00:09:25.675 --> 00:09:27.336
Are you sure?

00:09:28.177 --> 00:09:32.739
Sugar, do you really want me
to tell you what you should do?

00:09:33.583 --> 00:09:35.073
Um...

00:09:42.959 --> 00:09:45.052
I have to find the answer
for myself, don't I?

00:09:45.328 --> 00:09:46.529
-Good girl.

00:09:46.529 --> 00:09:47.553
-Good girl.
-Yeah!

00:09:50.967 --> 00:09:53.169
This is your final trial.

00:09:53.169 --> 00:09:56.832
But you know, you are
not the only one who hurts.

00:09:57.373 --> 00:09:59.534
Sugar, where are you?

00:10:02.278 --> 00:10:03.939
Get that for me.

00:10:27.303 --> 00:10:28.805
Saga.

00:10:28.805 --> 00:10:31.774
All we can do is
watch over them.

00:10:31.874 --> 00:10:33.341
I know that, but...

00:10:33.976 --> 00:10:36.779
Those two will
be ok. I know it.

00:10:36.779 --> 00:10:38.337
Yes, you're right.

00:10:43.953 --> 00:10:46.114
Don't tell me she already
left for the fairy world!

00:10:50.326 --> 00:10:51.816
Sugar!

00:10:53.563 --> 00:10:54.552
Saga.

00:10:57.433 --> 00:10:59.924
You haven't gone back yet.
Thank goodness.

00:11:01.370 --> 00:11:04.430
Could it be that you
were looking for me, Saga?

00:11:13.850 --> 00:11:16.614
Saga!
I... I...

00:11:17.420 --> 00:11:18.751
Saga.

00:11:20.256 --> 00:11:21.245
Saga.

00:11:28.731 --> 00:11:30.722
Please wait a little longer!

00:11:33.202 --> 00:11:37.832
Sugar, long before
you and I met...

00:11:37.940 --> 00:11:40.966
I saw one...
A Snow Fairy.

00:11:41.577 --> 00:11:42.544
Huh?

00:11:53.589 --> 00:11:55.758
Saga, you met a Snow Fairy?

00:11:55.758 --> 00:12:00.058
Yeah, I remembered.
I think it was when I was about 4.

00:12:00.930 --> 00:12:04.923
Yes. It was on the snowy
winter's day we moved to this town.

00:12:11.841 --> 00:12:15.538
I was bored, so I hid
myself under the piano cover.

00:12:16.646 --> 00:12:18.841
I bet Mommy
will be surprised.

00:12:35.665 --> 00:12:37.155
Are you all right?

00:12:40.202 --> 00:12:41.965
Saga! Saga!

00:12:42.571 --> 00:12:45.734
Hold on! Don't let go!
We'll save you!

00:12:46.208 --> 00:12:48.301
Mommy, I'm scared!

00:12:48.744 --> 00:12:50.234
Saga!

00:12:51.647 --> 00:12:54.309
Saga, don't let go! Saga!

00:12:58.888 --> 00:13:00.549
I can't hold on!

00:13:33.522 --> 00:13:35.114
Saga!

00:13:36.792 --> 00:13:38.282
Is she ok?

00:13:47.269 --> 00:13:49.672
The snow that caught me...

00:13:49.672 --> 00:13:52.470
I remember that it was warm,
even though it was snow.

00:13:53.576 --> 00:13:55.144
Warm snow?

00:13:55.144 --> 00:13:57.806
It was a Snow Fairy who
made that snow fall, wasn't it?

00:13:58.681 --> 00:14:01.484
It was very pretty,
gentle snow.

00:14:01.484 --> 00:14:04.854
That is the snow in
your memory, isn't it?

00:14:04.854 --> 00:14:08.791
Yeah, I'm a little jealous
of that Snow Fairy.

00:14:08.791 --> 00:14:10.760
Awe, they're lucky!

00:14:10.760 --> 00:14:15.631
I want to make snow that turns
into wonderful memories, too!

00:14:15.631 --> 00:14:18.031
I want to make that snow!
I want to make that snow!
Your snow is the same.

00:14:19.001 --> 00:14:21.737
It's become a
treasured memory.

00:14:21.737 --> 00:14:25.107
My snow is...
In Saga's memory?

00:14:25.107 --> 00:14:29.009
Definitely!
I'll never forget it.

00:14:30.413 --> 00:14:33.143
Ever since I first saw it...

00:14:50.032 --> 00:14:51.693
Saga!

00:14:53.235 --> 00:14:54.827
Don't say that!

00:14:55.071 --> 00:14:58.507
Really! How could you say that silly
snow is a memory for you?

00:14:58.507 --> 00:15:00.407
You're too soft.

00:15:00.509 --> 00:15:01.134
Sugar.

00:15:01.243 --> 00:15:04.814
That snow's not ready yet.
Once I'm a full-fledged Snow Fairy,

00:15:04.814 --> 00:15:07.977
I'll make mountains
of much prettier snow.

00:15:09.452 --> 00:15:11.443
I see. That's true.

00:15:11.954 --> 00:15:16.391
Yeah. I'll become a full-fledged
Snow Fairy for sure.

00:15:17.126 --> 00:15:19.651
That's why...
That's why...

00:15:20.863 --> 00:15:23.423
I'm happy I met you, Saga!

00:15:23.566 --> 00:15:27.470
I'm really happy that you
looked out for me all this time!

00:15:27.470 --> 00:15:28.767
Me, too.

00:15:29.271 --> 00:15:31.637
I'm happy I met you, Sugar.

00:15:31.907 --> 00:15:33.898
Saga. Saga!

00:15:36.245 --> 00:15:37.735
Sugar...

00:15:50.893 --> 00:15:54.563
I have a feeling
I know what a "Twinkle" is.

00:15:54.563 --> 00:15:56.053
Me, too.

00:16:08.010 --> 00:16:09.773
Mr. Magic Flower.

00:16:18.187 --> 00:16:19.848
Congratulations, Sugar.

00:16:20.156 --> 00:16:21.783
Saga...

00:16:24.860 --> 00:16:26.362
Come on, don't cry.

00:16:26.362 --> 00:16:29.456
You're a full-fledged
Season Fairy now, you know.

00:16:30.199 --> 00:16:31.359
Yeah.

00:17:00.629 --> 00:17:02.460
That's pretty snow, Sugar.

00:17:03.933 --> 00:17:07.770
Thank you. I'm happy.

00:17:07.770 --> 00:17:09.897
Good-bye, Saga.

00:17:12.942 --> 00:17:15.137
Good-bye, Sugar.

00:17:16.679 --> 00:17:18.670
Good-bye, Saga!

00:17:19.915 --> 00:17:20.973
Saga!

00:17:21.650 --> 00:17:23.140
Saga!

00:17:24.587 --> 00:17:27.181
Sagaaa!

00:17:40.369 --> 00:17:42.071
She's gone.

00:17:42.071 --> 00:17:44.631
I guess that means it's ok...

00:17:45.207 --> 00:17:47.198
to cry now.

00:17:51.547 --> 00:17:54.414
Sugar!

00:18:00.489 --> 00:18:02.150
Sugar...

00:18:04.627 --> 00:18:08.495
And so,
Sugar disappeared from my sight.

00:18:08.597 --> 00:18:13.769
Also, from that day on I stopped
seeing Season Fairies altogether.

00:18:13.769 --> 00:18:19.308
The Elder, Ginger,
Turmeric, Basil, Cinnamon...

00:18:19.308 --> 00:18:21.833
I was never able
to see any of them again.

00:18:22.578 --> 00:18:24.569
And then, I...

00:18:39.595 --> 00:18:41.790
Anne!

00:18:42.798 --> 00:18:44.533
I'm sorry!
Did you wait long?

00:18:44.533 --> 00:18:47.127
Just the usual 5 minutes.

00:18:48.737 --> 00:18:51.140
Huh? Saga hasn't arrived yet?

00:18:51.140 --> 00:18:54.837
Yeah, go figure. I think she
probably got sidetracked "there" again.

00:18:54.943 --> 00:18:57.275
Honestly, that Saga. Again?

00:19:06.088 --> 00:19:09.758
Listening to Saga play the piano
while drinking good coffee...

00:19:09.758 --> 00:19:10.918
Here you go.

00:19:11.327 --> 00:19:14.229
You always left the
store just for this.

00:19:14.229 --> 00:19:16.390
You must be happy
the piano is back.

00:20:12.554 --> 00:20:15.457
You are definitely a
worthy rival, Miss Saga!

00:20:15.457 --> 00:20:17.982
And so, without further ado,
I challenge you!

00:20:18.727 --> 00:20:19.928
We thought you'd be here.

00:20:19.928 --> 00:20:24.695
Saga, Kanon is visiting today, so
we're going to buy waffles, right?

00:20:25.300 --> 00:20:28.437
I forgot! Do you think
the waffle guy is still open?

00:20:28.437 --> 00:20:29.665
It'll be ok if we hurry.

00:20:29.772 --> 00:20:31.569
Saga, hurry up.

00:20:31.607 --> 00:20:33.336
Where's my bag?

00:20:34.309 --> 00:20:35.901
No!

00:20:38.547 --> 00:20:41.016
The Hammond Theatre Troupe's
coming back!

00:20:41.016 --> 00:20:44.645
So I can meet
dear Cheryl again!

00:20:45.254 --> 00:20:47.923
Maybe I'll ask her to
look over the play I wrote.

00:20:47.923 --> 00:20:50.058
Yeah, do that.
Do that.

00:20:50.058 --> 00:20:51.457
Yeah, I'll do that.

00:20:52.394 --> 00:20:55.659
I hope I'll be able to play
with the bear pianist again.

00:20:57.499 --> 00:20:58.233
-I'm home.

00:20:58.233 --> 00:20:59.935
-I'm home.
-Saga Mommy!

00:20:59.935 --> 00:21:02.495
Kanon, it's been a while!

00:21:02.971 --> 00:21:04.939
Good afternoon, Miranda.

00:21:05.340 --> 00:21:08.173
Good afternoon.
Take care of Kanon tonight, ok?

00:21:08.377 --> 00:21:12.279
Leave her to me.
Well, Kanon, what shall we play?

00:21:12.381 --> 00:21:14.315
Well...

00:21:14.416 --> 00:21:17.908
Kanon, your mouth
is covered with icing.

00:21:18.020 --> 00:21:19.788
Before we play,
we'll have to take a bath.

00:21:19.788 --> 00:21:20.686
Huh?

00:21:21.089 --> 00:21:25.194
You're a girl, so you have to be clean.
I'll give you a good shampoo.

00:21:25.194 --> 00:21:27.162
What? No shampoo!

00:21:27.262 --> 00:21:30.754
No! I hate shampoo!

00:21:30.866 --> 00:21:32.527
No!

00:21:39.842 --> 00:21:43.512
Wow, that's pretty!
It looks like snow.

00:21:43.512 --> 00:21:45.343
It's Snow Fairy magic.

00:21:45.447 --> 00:21:46.709
Snow Fairy?

00:21:46.915 --> 00:21:50.452
Yeah. Do you know
about Season Fairies?

00:21:50.452 --> 00:21:58.494
They are tiny fairies who control
wind, rain, snow, and different seasons.

00:21:58.494 --> 00:22:02.828
Mysterious, cute fairies
that really do exist.

00:22:02.931 --> 00:22:05.100
Where are those fairies?

00:22:05.100 --> 00:22:07.125
Don't be silly!
I'm right over here!

00:22:07.336 --> 00:22:11.106
Sugar Baby Love

00:22:11.106 --> 00:22:14.109
Kuchibiru ni

00:22:14.109 --> 00:22:18.773
Namida no rouge...

00:22:38.534 --> 00:22:42.170
Sugar Baby Love

00:22:42.170 --> 00:22:49.269
Ai nante, shiritaku naiwa.

00:22:52.981 --> 00:22:56.752
Sugar Baby Love

00:22:56.752 --> 00:22:59.454
Kuchibiru ni

00:22:59.454 --> 00:23:02.912
Namida no rouge...

00:23:07.396 --> 00:23:11.066
Mokuyo ni

00:23:11.066 --> 00:23:14.002
Bara o kai,

00:23:14.002 --> 00:23:18.200
Tegami o soete.

00:23:21.877 --> 00:23:25.447
Sugar Baby Love

00:23:25.447 --> 00:23:28.350
Yume de au.

00:23:28.350 --> 00:23:33.447
Anata wa yasashii...

00:23:33.822 --> 00:23:37.883
I hope my snow becomes
a memory for everybody!
